Silero VAD model — models/silero_vad.onnx

This directory bundles the Silero Voice Activity Detection model, distributed by
the Silero Team under the MIT License. The ONNX graph here uses the
x/h/c -> prob/new_h/new_c interface (the combined-state / v4-style export) that
src/detect/silero.js is written against.

Upstream: https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad  (MIT)

Provenance note: this file was sourced this session from a local matched copy to
guarantee the exact I/O contract our runtime expects. It should be pinned to a
specific upstream silero-vad release when convenient (verify inputNames/outputNames
still match src/detect/silero.js if you re-source).

